&lt;p&gt;If you’re a builder and a closer who loves opening doors, winning meaningful business, and helping scale an ambitious fintech, we’d love to meet you.&lt;br&gt;This role will be hybrid in our Amsterdam office once finalized.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
