&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in fast-moving environments without an established playbook.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A builder mentality with a strong bias toward action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excited to use AI and automation to work smarter and rethink existing processes.&lt;/li&gt;
