&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Breeze, we&#39;re building the AI-powered infrastructure layer for global commerce, making it radically simpler for businesses to sell, get paid, and operate across markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We go far beyond traditional payment processing. Breeze combines global payments, AI, stablecoins, and a Merchant of Record-like model to take on the complexity businesses typically manage themselves, including compliance, risk, fraud, chargebacks, reconciliation, and customer support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our goal is simple: let businesses focus on building and selling great products while Breeze handles the complexity behind getting paid.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Backed by &lt;strong&gt;Sequoia Capital&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Multicoin Capital&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;The Chainsmokers&lt;/strong&gt;, Breeze is a successful, rapidly growing, and exceptionally well-capitalized company. We have the runway to think long term while remaining early enough that every person joining today can have a meaningful impact on what we build.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are hiring a Risk Operations Specialist!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;173&quot; data-end=&quot;220&quot;&gt;This role will be on our late shift, but will train on day shift.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our Risk Operations Specialist, you&#39;ll be on the front line of safeguarding our payments ecosystem. You&#39;ll identify, monitor, and mitigate fraud across card payments and crypto onramp and offramp transactions, keeping the experience secure and seamless for our users and merchants.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;173&quot; data-end=&quot;220&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits at the intersection of risk, operations, and product. You&#39;ll work alongside merchants, payment partners, Product Operations, and engineering, which makes it a strong fit for someone who enjoys combining analytical problem-solving with operational execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;173&quot; data-end=&quot;220&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who thrives in fast-moving environments, wants meaningful ownership, and is excited to build rather than simply maintain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze, monitor, and prevent fraud across both card and crypto transactions, at the user and transaction level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use internal risk tools and platforms, including Sift, to label, track, and manage high-risk users and transactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate suspicious activity and escalate potential fraud or compliance cases when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with merchants, payment partners, and internal teams to refine risk management strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product Operations to respond to risk-related customer inquiries and manage user concerns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with engineers to provide product feedback and request new features that strengthen our risk detection capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the ongoing development and automation of risk processes and playbooks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience in risk management, fraud prevention, payments, or compliance, ideally within payments, fintech, or financial services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail and sound judgment, which are critical for identifying and mitigating risk effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, analytical, and decision-making skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive mindset with the ability to work independently and collaborate cross-functionally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in fast-moving environments without an established playbook.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A builder mentality with a strong bias toward action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excited to use AI and automation to work smarter and rethink existing processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable getting into the details and doing the work, regardless of seniority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience at an early-stage or high-growth startup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with payment gateways, banks, or high-risk merchant categories, for example gaming, travel, and hospitality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using fraud detection tools such as Sift, Riskified, Feedzai, or Forter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How We Work&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act Now, Improve Later:&lt;/strong&gt; Ship something real today. Move fast, learn from what happens, and make it better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disagree and Commit:&lt;/strong&gt; Debate hard before a decision. Once it&#39;s made, commit fully and make the outcome right.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customers First:&lt;/strong&gt; When in doubt, start with what&#39;s most painful for the customer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own It, End to End:&lt;/strong&gt; Don&#39;t wait to be asked. If you see a problem, take responsibility for solving it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Default to Public:&lt;/strong&gt; Share context openly so the whole team can move faster and learn from each other.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High Standards, Genuine Warmth:&lt;/strong&gt; Hold the bar high and treat people well. Be direct, rigorous, kind, and low ego.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Outcomes Over Activity:&lt;/strong&gt; We care about what ships, what works, and what moves the needle, not how busy you look.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Forward, Always Learning:&lt;/strong&gt; Experiment with new tools, automate the repetitive, share what works, and continuously rethink how you can work smarter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Compensation Philosophy&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe compensation should be fair, competitive, consistent, and transparent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We benchmark compensation against the market and establish thoughtful bands for each role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compensation reflects experience, skills, location, role scope, and expected impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We don&#39;t believe pay should primarily depend on how aggressively someone negotiates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eligible employees receive meaningful equity, so the people building Breeze can participate in the long-term value they help create.&lt;/li&gt;
